{"id":341,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"課題共有と解決力を育む女性教育","feature_description":"東京女学館は「高い品性を備え、社会に貢献する女性の育成」を教育目標にしています。多様な個人の考えを生かして課題を共有し、協力して解決する「インクルーシブ・リーダーシップ」を育てます。教育では、心の教育、日本文化への理解、グローバル市民教育、STEAM教育を重点に据え、生徒が社会との関わりの中で考え行動する力を養います。多様な価値観を尊重する姿勢も育てます。","clubs":[{"id":5723,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5724,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5725,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5726,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5727,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5728,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5729,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5730,"name":"ソフトボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5731,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5732,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5733,"name":"ギター部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5734,"name":"オーケストラ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5735,"name":"箏曲部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://mhs.tjk.ed.jp/school_life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":5736,"name":"英語部","category":"文化部","s